Before: the 9050 flow (910, Eastsun 0819) read one value per layer from Prod.TrayZ_Up/Down[MAX_TRACK=9] (layer counts -1..19, out of bounds), EmptyZ_* / Auto1~3Z_*[20] and Home / extra-lift / probe-start fields that no ini key, screen or C++ line ever wrote (all 0); HOME sent MLoaderZ to 0.
Now: TECH (LastSet.h, last field's line) + iTrayZ9050UpBase/DownBase/Pitch/Home/Lift[5], ProbeStart, ProbeLimit; cinitial.cpp EOF W906_TrayZ9050(zone, up, layer) = base - layer*pitch, Home / Lift / ProbeStart / ProbeLimit (0 = the old 20), read from Tech. Every 9050 read in acatchtray.cpp, asendic_Loader.cpp, csystem.cpp (DoReceiveAllToBottom_9050) and uhome.cpp (HOME Loader Z) calls them, same line; the flow's steps, layer increments and Up / Down / Home / Up+lift choices are 910's; golden's TrayZ_Up (asendic.cpp) untouched.
Teach: tools/gen_teach_registry.py EXT_ROWS +27 (keys setEditTZ9050*, sections [MLoaderZ] / [MEmptyZ] / [MAuto1Z..3Z]); fTeachRegistry.cpp extension block regenerated (+27 lines), Teach.gen.inc / WebTeachButtons.gen.inc regenerated, gen_teach_editlist.py --check OK.
Tests: Flow9050_Tray 104/104 (Tech set so the formula gives the old per-layer values + a [TZ] formula block: layers -1..19, pitch subtracted, Home / lift, out-of-range zone = 0, probe limit default 20 / taught); WebMotorAccess (extension rows 7 -> 34), TeachButtonsGen, GA1_LastSet, TeachKb, WebTeachLeave, TeachFormShowBridge, ST02C9_TeachSt02 pass; GearTeachSave = known (snapshot args). Debug 22:49, release 22:57 (affected targets only, EastSun '只編有改到的'). Web: see the web commit of the same name. Backup branch backup/pre-trayzpitch-20261006. WORKLOG section 2 row 140.

