+//  EastSun 1006: 「第幾層不是用pitch來算嗎？」「每一層一定是有一個基準層 用pitch算上去」「基準層pitch要用減的」「交接位置不就是 上位嗎？」
+//  →「對那額外抬升也要校正」「其他站額外抬升也要保留」「探測就是上位 加層數 然後要可以讓我設探測極限」「這個值要可以校正」.
+//  BEFORE: the 9050 flow (Eastsun 20260819, 910 port) read one taught value per layer -- Prod.TrayZ_Up/Down[layer] (golden's per-TRACK
+//  arrays [MAX_TRACK=9], indexed by a layer count that runs -1..19, i.e. out of bounds), Prod.EmptyZ_* / Auto1~3Z_* [20] and the
+//  Home / extra-lift / probe-start fields -- none of which any ini key, screen or line of C++ ever wrote (all 0; cprod_9050.inc head).
+//  NOW: zone 0 Loader (MLoaderZ) / 1 Empty (MEmptyZ) / 2-4 Auto1-3 (MAuto1Z-3Z):
+//      layer N Up   = Tech.iTrayZ9050UpBase[z]   - N * Tech.iTrayZ9050Pitch[z]
+//      layer N Down = Tech.iTrayZ9050DownBase[z] - N * Tech.iTrayZ9050Pitch[z]
+//      Home = Tech.iTrayZ9050Home[z], hand-over extra lift = Tech.iTrayZ9050Lift[z],
+//      Loader probe start layer = Tech.iTrayZ9050ProbeStart, probe limit = Tech.iTrayZ9050ProbeLimit (0 = unset -> 20, the old
+//      hard-coded MAX_LOADER_LAYER_9050).
+//  Taught on the Teach page (tools/gen_teach_registry.py EXT_ROWS -> teach.ini [MLoaderZ] / [MEmptyZ] / [MAuto1Z..3Z]). Read from Tech
+//  directly, so a Teach-page save takes effect on the next move (Prod would wait for the next START). The flow's step order, its
+//  layer increments and its per-step choice of Up / Down / Home / Up+lift are 910's, unchanged; only where each position comes from
+//  changed. Golden's Prod.TrayZ_Up[] (asendic.cpp CylinderUp / AutoCylinderUp, other machines) and its writer are untouched.
+int W906_TrayZ9050(int zone, int up, int layer)
+{
+    if(zone < 0 || zone > 4)
+        return 0;
+    const int base = up ? Tech.iTrayZ9050UpBase[zone] : Tech.iTrayZ9050DownBase[zone];
+    return base - layer * Tech.iTrayZ9050Pitch[zone];
+}
+int W906_TrayZ9050Home(int zone)
+{
+    return (zone < 0 || zone > 4) ? 0 : Tech.iTrayZ9050Home[zone];
+}
+int W906_TrayZ9050Lift(int zone)
+{
+    return (zone < 0 || zone > 4) ? 0 : Tech.iTrayZ9050Lift[zone];
+}
+int W906_TrayZ9050ProbeStart()
+{
+    return Tech.iTrayZ9050ProbeStart;
+}
+int W906_TrayZ9050ProbeLimit()
+{
+    return (Tech.iTrayZ9050ProbeLimit > 0) ? Tech.iTrayZ9050ProbeLimit : MAX_LOADER_LAYER_9050;
+}
